    "body": "The i7 rows for **71154c1dc4661e7bfa30e89d8b434a9394f2feaa** against main 6e0dffd3, John. bench-hashes 5c1a092f is the last bench before the pipeline contender, since main has no pipeline. Over 13 points (the turn and interleaved cells, batches, continuous 64 B and 64 KiB, one message 64 B and 1 KiB, 1024 messages, a Merkle tree and git objects): **no cell slower** at 4 pairs or on the 64-pair suspects, and no level cell's instructions moved beyond 0.5%. These Plain-mode cells leave the keyed grouping cost unmeasured. [Data](https://github.com/devonjonte/bench-hashes/tree/data/2026-11-08/main318-i7).\n\n\u2014 Devon Jonte\n",
